# Codex local control-plane archives.
# These files are useful during active cluster/debug work, but they are not part
# of the public modernization surface. Compact evidence may still be added with
# `git add -f` when a milestone explicitly calls for it.
codex/agents/
codex/state/
codex/workspaces/
codex/runbooks/*
!codex/runbooks/CLEAN_002_RECONCILIATION_20260618.md
!codex/runbooks/MODERNIZATION_STATUS.md
!codex/runbooks/MODERNIZATION_WORKFLOW.md
